  (Q1 — §10, scope-auditor ESCALATE) Removing a DQ test (the not_null on stg_apif__standings.team_id) — even a redundant, mis-placed one — touches "DQ is non-negotiable", so the classification (mechanical layering correction vs DQ weakening) is the CPO's. Cleanliness is preserved at the cleaned layer (base_apif__standings drops `where team_id is not null`; fct_standings.team_sk has not_null + relationships(dim_team)); staging must stay a faithful 1:1 flatten, so a not_null on a provider-nullable column is mis-placed there (events staging has no such test).
