  (Q2 — self-heal safety, scope-auditor; answered by builder, NOT §10) Does the API guarantee finished fixtures' events are immutable so the self-heal stays self-limiting? ANSWER: yes — fct_fixture_event's design comment relies on "once a fixture is FINISHED its event list does not change"; the self-heal inherits that invariant. Verifiable fact, not a CPO call.
